; benchmark.meta description: Zooms Vector Clockwork's 1,000 gears from fit in about tenfold and back by command scrolls, panning between, while half its movements turn as stamped transforms with fine teeth, even-odd cutouts and strokes, the demo's defaults, in a real 1440 x 900 window at scale 2 with its toolbar and stats panel, reporting each committed frame's main-thread phases, GPU time and scripted input latency.
; benchmark.meta timing: not-recommended
; benchmark.meta profiles: gui-window
(blank)
(import ./../fixtures/clockwork-bench-fixture)
(import /gui)
(blank)

(main
  (<> App
    (<> ClockworkBenchWindow
      (= script (. ClockworkBenchScript zoom))
      (= moving-steps 180)
      (= result-name "clockwork/window-clockwork-zoom")
    )
  )
)
